msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Perego Media Lightbox"
msgstr ""

#: src/Blocks/media-lightbox/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "The site-wide accessible image/video/gallery lightbox dialog (ported from the handoff's main.js lightbox IIFE). Renders once per page in the footer template part; its view script delegates a click listener to every [data-image]/[data-video]/[data-gallery] trigger anywhere on the page, so any block can open it without wiring its own dialog."
msgstr ""

